- entry .Suggestion   one completion candidate: the text to insert, with a description and how the shell should treat it
+ entry .Suggestion   un candidato de compleción: el texto que se inserta, con una descripción y cómo debe tratarlo la shell

= entry .Suggestion   one completion candidate: the text to insert, with a description and how the shell should treat it
-   detail
+   detail

-       A `Suggestion` is what every completion source — a `Subcommand`, a `Discoverable`, a
-       `Pathname`, a `Flag` listing — produces, and what `Completion#serialize` renders for
-       the shell. `#core` is the text inserted, between `#prefix` and `#suffix` (so `#text`
-       is the whole word); `#description` is shown by zsh, fish and PowerShell; `#hidden`
-       candidates are matched but not listed (and only zsh matches them); `#incomplete`
-       tells the shell not to end the word, for a path completed a segment at a time;
-       `#aliases` list the other names shown beside it; `#operand` marks a value offered for
-       an operand rather than a subcommand, so the help tree does not descend into it; and
-       `#display` is what the menu shows when it differs from what is inserted.
+       Una `Suggestion` es lo que produce cada fuente de compleción —un `Subcommand`, un
+       `Discoverable`, un `Pathname`, un listado de `Flag`— y lo que `Completion#serialize`
+       representa para la shell. `#core` es el texto que se inserta, entre `#prefix` y
+       `#suffix` (así que `#text` es la palabra entera); `#description` la muestran zsh, fish
+       y PowerShell; los candidatos `#hidden` se comparan pero no se listan (y solo zsh los
+       compara); `#incomplete` indica a la shell que no cierre la palabra, para una ruta que se
+       completa tramo a tramo; `#aliases` enumera los otros nombres que se muestran a su lado;
+       `#operand` marca un valor que se ofrece para un operando y no un subcomando, de modo que
+       el árbol de ayuda no desciende a él; y `#display` es lo que muestra el menú cuando
+       difiere de lo que se inserta.

=       `#display` is what the menu shows when it differs from what is inserted.
=
-       ```scala
+       ```scala

=       `#display` is what the menu shows when it differs from what is inserted.
=
=       ```scala
-       import soundness.*
+       import soundness.*

-       Suggestion(t"release", t"an optimised build")
+       Suggestion(t"release", t"an optimised build")

-       Suggestion(t"src/", incomplete = true)
+       Suggestion(t"src/", incomplete = true)

=       Suggestion(t"src/", incomplete = true)
-       ```
