-         _can't drive the terminal: `reason`_. The reasons:
+         _can't drive the terminal: `reason`_. Los motivos:

-         ```tabular
+         ```tabular

-         column  Case
-         column  Code
-         column  Message
-         column  Note
+         column  Caso
